{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_06",
  "title": "The Surrounded",
  "storyCode": "NL-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f130a0376de66aab500d8aa7c4317feca66b3203f1da896a8b2404fe546c5fef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 6-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "The Infected are making their move.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "They'll really charge through the front door?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "They'd better. The bigger their ruckus, the less we leave the Board to use against us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "How are things at the power plant?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Are you doubting me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "I wouldn't dare.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Can I kill Wild Mane?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "Of course... now that things have come to this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "If we find ourselves some prey, that'll help make our owners less grumpy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "They're prey who got away to begin with... I'm just taking back what should've been mine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Contact Team 3. Have them pack it up and come with me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Wild Mane spotted! Wild—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Too slow, Armorless!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Urgh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Pulling dirty tricks in the shadows... Don't tell me you people have forgotten how to take on a knight!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Filthy Infected!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "This is for Jamie and all the innocent who died by your hands!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Eek—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "—Iwona! Don't forget what Sona said. Avoid killing anyone if you can... At the very least, when you kill them, make sure you're prepared to handle it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Hey, you. Armorless... How many people have you killed?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Heh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Trying to act all righteous now, are we? Hypocritical brat. Back when I was a bounty hunter on the Golden Prairie, I never gave a crap about that!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Have you forgotten what life outside the cities is like? Those who stand at the top, the strongest survivors, are all cold-blooded bastards! That's the way it goes!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "—Say whatever you want, but I've won.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "When you've lost, when you're dead, nothing you say matters.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "You—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "He probably sent out a distress signal just now...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Hopefully that'll lure the Armorless Union here. That'll make Greynuty's job easier.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "text": "Fartooth, have you spotted any Armorless over there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "No.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "What about you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "text": "Greynuty's already in position. Just waiting on our signal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "text": "That said, the Armorless can't be this slow to react... Did Wild Mane really manage to lure them her way?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "She probably...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "Armorless spotted. They're heading your way from an alleyway on 4th Street, Iwona!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "Iwona...? Can you hear me? Iwona?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "Hey?! Szewczyk? Iwona?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "text": "The transmission... got cut? No way... In a city with this much transmission traffic...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "This silence is creepy... Iwona. I have a bad feeling about this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "Are those Armorless guys really such pushovers that we can take them down with an ambush?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "I'm not sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Bigger problem, I'm not getting any of Justyna's transmissions, and she should be staring down at us from somewhere up high right—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "(Shudder)—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "—Move!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All of a sudden, Iwona is overwhelmed with an aura so suffocating that it threatens to make her puke.\nShe isn't sure this is really a biological response. It could be some kind of toxin or an Arts effect.\nThen, a figure leaps down from the top of a tall tower.\nThe figure lands on the ground. The landing is silent as the veil lightly covering her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "You jumped from so high up, but you didn't even let out a peep, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Must be nice to be a Feline.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Team 3...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "What?! When did they—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "(The difference between these guys and the ones we fought just now are night and day... She's wearing blue. Is she the Lazurite from the other day?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "You go on ahead...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "But!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "You'd better survive this!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "Aargh?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "—?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "No way. I didn't even see her pull that bowstring—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Armorless Union operative in blue maintains her one-handed throwing posture.\nA hint of dissatisfaction comes through her cold expression. After all, this hunt started on an unlucky note."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "She... threw it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "Aghh! My leg. My leg!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Grit your teeth and keep running! Don't stop!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Hey, stop looking around! I'm right here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Are you Infected all idiots? Look how many bows we have aimed at you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Wild Mane Knight, you should be dead several days by now. Good on you, though. You still have the chance to play hero today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Now run. I don't want this hunt to end on a such a boring note. Let's kill some time together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Hah, you seem to be mistaken.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Do I look like the kind of gal who hides in the shadows?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "You look like the kind who's getting herself killed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "*Spit*. We Infected are sick of toiling our miserable lives away like that!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "You're just a bunch of despicable bastards hiding behind the K.G.C.C., doing all kinds of shady business. Every one of us living out in the open is stronger than you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Remember their faces!\nRemember... These knights... These Kazimierzians... These cold-blooded murderers...\nDon't let them get away with it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Armorless scum...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Have you ever fought a gloompincer on the brink of death? Do you know how a dying, cornered animal fights?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "You're too full of yourself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "I may die, but that doesn't mean I'll lose. And you. You'll pay your dues right here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Then... My friends will...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Look at you. No fear of death on your face. You don't want to live, yet you still want to win. Ridiculous.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The blue Armorless Union operative takes out an arrow from behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Come.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "You're going to use that arrow as a blade? What, you looking down on me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "You little...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Urgh—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "So that's the speed you Kuranta are so proud of?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Don't underestimate me—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Hraaagh––!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Don't be such a crybaby. I made sure not to kill you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Now let me see how much blood you have to spill.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "After I've painted the entire street with it, the Infected hiding in the dark will probably stop resisting?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Um, Lazurite, she is Infected though...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "If you're worried about catching it, you should look for a new job.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Once death calms her down, it'll be much easier to deal with the resisting Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "It's been a while since I heard from Justyna...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "Maybe she ran into some kind of trouble?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "Either way, there's five minutes till our ambush.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "Sona should be in position by now. We just have to trust each other.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "text": "It's almost time...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sona",
      "text": "Everyone, be safe...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "You didn't even last a few minutes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Go on... There should be seven or eight Infected hideouts around here, though I wouldn't be surprised if they're empty by now. Search all of them, one by one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Get... back... here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "I'm not... done yet!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "I'm leaving her to you. Not worth any more of my time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "Right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "All units, prepare to fire—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "text": "Didn't I just say... I'm not done?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "text": "—She still has the strength to fight?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "I don't want to kill too many people here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "The old and the young can go, but I'll take the heads of ten Infected knights back to keep my bosses happy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "You... You murderer!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "What did you do to Iwona?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "She should probably have passed out from the blood loss by now, though it sounds like she might still be putting up a fight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "You monster—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "You should know that even if you manage to get away now, it won't vindicate you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "I'll say it again. Ten Infected knights for the lives of everyone else.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "How can we trust you?! You're just a bunch of murderers, a bunch of sick bastards!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "I'll count Iwona... Just the lives of nine more knights.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "You—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Are you sure you can win?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Never mind, then... It'll be faster if I do it myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Now what's the rush?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "If you want to keep your bosses happy, surely you'd want quality over quantity?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Wouldn't you agree?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Toland Cash.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Not to toot my own horn, but I'm sure I'm worth a hefty sum on the wanted posters?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "If you are willing to give me your own head, then I won't need any more.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "Don't taunt her, Toland! She's—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "'Lazurite' Monique of the Armorless Union, am I correct?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "I said it before... I don't like to be interrupted when I'm working.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "If you don't plan on giving yourself up, that makes three times you've interrupted me, Toland Cash.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The injured Infected knight isn't able to see everything clearly.\nBy the time his eardrums react, there's a sharp clashing sound."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Phew~ You really are quick on the draw with that bowstring.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "You saw it...? No, your stance... That's the swordhand of a knight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Since when do bounty hunters have tricks like that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Oh, don't say that. If all we knew was shooting arrows, setting up traps, pulling dirty tricks, and waiting for our prey...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Would we really be any different from the scum in the Armorless Union?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "You won't dodge many more of my shots.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "You sure?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Whew, that was close.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Might want to watch your step, though.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "Nngh—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "An explosive trap...? You're still a bounty hunter in the end...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Toland",
      "text": "Needless to say.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "—?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "—A charge... You've received knight training?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "That's it. You're helping the Nearls... so you must have something tied up with them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "text": "This really piques my interest, but work is work. We can't waste too much time on you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A Corporate Employee",
      "text": "Man, what a pain... There's just no catching a taxi during the Major, is there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A Tourist",
      "text": "Excuse me, which way is the Holiday Knight Souvenir Shop?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A Tourist",
      "text": "Hey, look at the time. Let's find a restaurant and get a bite to eat first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greatmouth Mob",
      "text": "Will you look at that?! Our Columbian newbie is about to overwhelm Wisteria Knight once again!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greatmouth Mob",
      "text": "Impressive speed! Now just one more—Hold on, hold on! What's going on?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greatmouth Mob",
      "text": "Unbelievable! A devastating accident at the very last moment! Did our newbie trip?! Come on, this is the Major! Get up!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Młynar",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Do you always leave work this late, Młynar?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Młynar",
      "text": "To what do I owe the pleasure...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Młynar",
      "text": "If I had known in advance, Lady Russell, I would've received you more properly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Russell",
      "text": "Don't worry yourself. I won't be taking up much of your time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Russell",
      "text": "Tonight will be messy. There will be lots for us to take care of.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Młynar",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Russell",
      "text": "Młynar, is the sword-bearing wanderer back?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Młynar",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Russell",
      "text": "The wanderer traveled through corpse-laden battlefields and boundless wastelands, at last making it to the fortress lit ablaze by cannonfire. Is the wanderer not back yet?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Młynar",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "—I still haven't heard anything from them, but we can't wait any longer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "In five minutes, we'll begin our ambush and cut off the core power source. The core district, where the General Chamber of Commerce is, will lose all power.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "Then, and only then, will Sona have a chance to break inside.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "A big show then, huh? I like it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "Our Adeptus 'friends' should have withdrawn the security here, clearing a path for us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "We need to be quick. Get ready—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "text": "W-What's that?! Where was that explosion?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "T-The power supply sector? Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "text": "Ashlock! Why did you start the operation early?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Greynuty",
      "text": "No, we haven't started the charge yet—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "text": "—We've been had. Get out of there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "Now sleep, Kawalerielki, my beloved Grand Knight Territory.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "text": "Good night.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
